    slug: "ats-reporting-vs-people-analytics-unterschied-personalberatung",
    title: "Von Pipeline-Zahlen zu People-Insights: was Recruiting-Teams wirklich trennt und verbindet",
    seoTitle: "ATS-Reporting vs. People Analytics: was zählt wirklich | ShortSelect",
    date: "2024-08-04",
